---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q8"
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |  Sort: ALL_NATIONS.O_YEAR ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |   Projection: ALL_NATIONS.O_YEAR, sum(CASE WHEN ALL_NATIONS.NATION = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN ALL_NATIONS.VOLUME ELSE Int64(0) END) / sum(ALL_NATIONS.VOLUME) AS MKT_SHARE                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[ALL_NATIONS.O_YEAR]], aggr=[[sum(CASE WHEN ALL_NATIONS.NATION = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN ALL_NATIONS.VOLUME ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(ALL_NATIONS.VOLUME)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: ALL_NATIONS                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |         Projection: date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_ORDERDATE) AS O_YEAR, snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_EXTENDEDPRICE * (Int64(1) - snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_DISCOUNT) AS VOLUME, n2.N_NAME AS NATION                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: n1.N_REGIONKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.REGION.R_REGIONKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER.S_NATIONKEY = n2.N_NATIONKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.CUSTOMER.C_NATIONKEY = n1.N_NATIONKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_CUSTKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.CUSTOMER.C_CUSTKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                   Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_ORDERKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_ORDERKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                     Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_PARTKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_PARTKEY AND snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER.S_SUPPKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_SUPPKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                       Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                         TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART projection=[P_PARTKEY], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_TYPE = Utf8("ECONOMY ANODIZED STEEL")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                         TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER projection=[S_SUPPKEY, S_NATIONKEY]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                       TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM projection=[L_ORDERKEY, L_PARTKEY, L_SUPPKEY, L_EXTENDEDPRICE, L_DISCOUNT]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                     TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS projection=[O_ORDERKEY, O_CUSTKEY, O_ORDERDATE], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_ORDERDATE BETWEEN CAST(Utf8("1995-01-01") AS Date32) AND CAST(Utf8("1996-12-31") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                   TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.CUSTOMER projection=[C_CUSTKEY, C_NATIONKEY]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                   TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION projection=[N_NATIONKEY, N_REGIONKEY]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |               SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                 TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION projection=[N_NATIONKEY, N_NAME]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |             TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.REGION projection=[R_REGIONKEY], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.REGION.R_NAME = Utf8("AMERICA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=snowflake compute_context=username=SGREBNOV,account=MAAGZJQ-BIB84773,warehouse=COMPUTE_WH,role=accountadmin base_sql=SELECT "ALL_NATIONS"."O_YEAR", (sum(CASE WHEN ("ALL_NATIONS"."NATION" = 'BRAZIL') THEN "ALL_NATIONS"."VOLUME" ELSE 0 END) / sum("ALL_NATIONS"."VOLUME")) AS "MKT_SHARE" FROM (SELECT date_part('YEAR', "ORDERS"."O_ORDERDATE") AS "O_YEAR", ("LINEITEM"."L_EXTENDEDPRICE" * (1 - "LINEITEM"."L_DISCOUNT")) AS "VOLUME", "n2"."N_NAME" AS "NATION" FROM "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."PART" INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."SUPPLIER" ON ("PART"."P_TYPE" = 'ECONOMY ANODIZED STEEL') INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."LINEITEM" ON (("PART"."P_PARTKEY" = "LINEITEM"."L_PARTKEY") AND ("SUPPLIER"."S_SUPPKEY" = "LINEITEM"."L_SUPPKEY")) INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."ORDERS" ON (("LINEITEM"."L_ORDERKEY" = "ORDERS"."O_ORDERKEY") AND ("ORDERS"."O_ORDERDATE" BETWEEN CAST('1995-01-01' AS DATE) AND CAST('1996-12-31' AS DATE))) INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."CUSTOMER" ON ("ORDERS"."O_CUSTKEY" = "CUSTOMER"."C_CUSTKEY") INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."NATION" AS "n1" ON ("CUSTOMER"."C_NATIONKEY" = "n1"."N_NATIONKEY") INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."NATION" AS "n2" ON ("SUPPLIER"."S_NATIONKEY" = "n2"."N_NATIONKEY") INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."REGION" ON (("n1"."N_REGIONKEY" = "REGION"."R_REGIONKEY") AND ("REGION"."R_NAME" = 'AMERICA'))) AS "ALL_NATIONS" GROUP BY "ALL_NATIONS"."O_YEAR" ORDER BY "ALL_NATIONS"."O_YEAR" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
